  "bodyHash": "d85de6c0403b582a",
  "content": "\n\n<p>一支在混沌時空中結盟的先遣部隊提前抵達了這個世界。他們由來自各個平行世界的軍隊以及開發團隊的其他模組組成。《先鋒部隊》（Advance Force）是一款以軍事戰爭為主題的模組，包含可操控的戰鬥 AI 士兵、多種可由玩家或 AI 駕駛的軍事武裝載具、連擊獎勵支援技能、強大的怪獸軍隊，以及一些防守挑戰任務。</p>\n<p>相依模組：本模組基於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/warmachinelib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>WarMachineLib</strong></a> 開發，主要目的是展示目前能實現的最新功能，為玩家提供 AI 士兵與載具，並相較於作者的其他模組，能快速更新至更高版本。</p>\n<p>選配安裝：安裝 <a href=\"SagerFX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SagerFX</a> 以獲得完整的粒子特效體驗（若未安裝此模組，粒子特效將相當簡陋）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1264783/description_730228cc-5947-42b3-b401-b716af1b38bd.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1264783/description_d5561bd7-42b3-b401-b716af1b38bd.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1264783/description_b13fdcc5-5689-4301-9fa3-4a0bd193266a.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1264783/description_2ace6a4f-f9a2-4128-8684-d23fb7bc3953.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1264783/description_abe86d4f-8a86-4576-859a-747e81612239.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1264783/description_50b0108c-e56b-489c-8c98-9da27a8ebd6e.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1264783/description_39188caa-aff4-4f59-9d2c-e10b146c6e3c.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1264783/description_da4f235c-be19-45d9-8c3b-fd0003ab9d62.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1264783/description_114b26c6-c5d3-4e1a-b300-90579e61a594.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1264783/description_625ab465-00ba-4796-8238-db736e7f8075.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1264783/description_537bb36a-e820-4f04-89d5-35bd218a628e.png\"></p>",
